      "title": "Editorial: obsolete RFC4646 references should be RFC5646",
      "url": "https://github.com/json-structure/alternate-names/issues/1",
      "state": "CLOSED",
      "author": "clemensv",
      "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "The following minor editorial issues were found during review:\n\n### 1. Obsolete RFC4646 in references block (line 31)\n\n`RFC4646` is obsolete. Update to `RFC5646` (BCP 47, Tags for Identifying Languages).\n\n### 2. `altnames` section cites RFC4646 (line 85)\n\n> The language code MUST conform to {{RFC4646}}.\n\nShould be `{{RFC5646}}`.\n\n### 3. `descriptions` section cites RFC4646 (line 188)\n\n> The language code MUST conform to {{RFC4646}}.\n\nShould be `{{RFC5646}}`.\n\nAll three instances need to be updated to reference RFC 5646 consistently.",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-08T06:28:01Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-08T08:50:08Z",
      "closedAt": "2026-06-08T08:50:08Z",
      "comments": []
    }
  ],
